'''Nord Spear''' is the seventh, [[Deep North]]-tier [[Spears|spear]].

* Its primary attack is a thrust. 
* The secondary attack throws the spear for 1.5x damage.

It cannot be crafted directly, instead the player must craft the corresponding [[Cast Nord Spear]] and harden it in a [[Frost Foundry]]. 

== Mould ==
'''Mould: Nord Spear''' can be found:
* By destroying trash piles in [[Winding Tunnels]].
* In chests buried at [[Memorial Site]]s.
* From [[Loot chest#Granary Barrel|Granary Barrel]]s in [[Abandoned Village]]s.
* By destroying weapon stands on the last floor of [[Mörkhalla]].

== Upgrade information ==
Like most Deep North-tier weapons, the Nord Spear can be upgraded to one of the following two variants using essences:

* {{Item link|Frostfire Spear}} (with a [[Frostfire Essence]])
* {{Item link|Thunderblood Spear}} (with a [[Thunderblood Essence]])

An upgraded Nord Spear will '''NOT''' keep its upgrade level when it is modified using essences.

